[2026-06-04 23:26:00] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"059ae0d2-8fd8-4e64-bae4-d3af4f8980ee","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\059ae0d2-8fd8-4e64-bae4-d3af4f8980ee.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-03\\2026-06-03-开发流程-05-后端BDD.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-03\\2026-06-03-开发流程-05-后端BDD.md","content":"# 单项目开发流程 — 后端 BDD（Backend）\n\n> 文档日期：2026-06-03\n> 所属系列：单项目开发完整流程\n> 阶段定位：后端开发用 BDD 验证业务逻辑\n\n---\n\n## 一、核心目标\n\n- 对应 Product BDD 场景，拆解成 API 调用、数据库操作、状态变更\n- 对应 TDD：写单元测试，保证服务逻辑符合 BDD\n\n---\n\n## 二、后端 BDD 模板\n\n```gherkin\nFeature: {功能名称} - 后端\n\n  Scenario: {正向场景}\n    Given {前置数据状态}\n    When 发送 {Method} 请求至 \"{Path}\"，请求体:\n      \"\"\"\n      {请求体 JSON}\n      \"\"\"\n    Then 响应状态码应为 {StatusCode}\n    And 响应体应包含:\n      \"\"\"\n      {预期响应}\n      \"\"\"\n    And 数据库中 {表} 应 {状态变更}\n\n  Scenario: {异常场景}\n    Given {异常前置条件}\n    When 发送 {Method} 请求至 \"{Path}\"\n    Then 响应状态码应为 {ErrorStatusCode}\n    And 响应体应包含错误码 \"{ErrorCode}\"\n\n  Scenario: {边界场景}\n    Given {边界条件}\n    When 发送 {Method} 请求至 \"{Path}\"\n    Then {边界预期结果}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 三、示例（文章收藏）\n\n```gherkin\nFeature: 文章收藏 - 后端\n\n  Scenario: 创建收藏记录\n    Given 用户 user-001 存在\n    And 文章 article-042 存在\n    And 用户未收藏过文章 article-042\n    When 发送 POST 请求至 \"/api/v1/favorites\"，请求体:\n      \"\"\"\n      {\"article_id\": 42}\n      \"\"\"\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体应包含:\n      \"\"\"\n      {\"success\": true, \"favorite_id\": 1}\n      \"\"\"\n    And 数据库 favorites 表应新增一条记录\n\n  Scenario: 重复收藏返回错误\n    Given 用户已收藏过文章 article-042\n    When 发送 POST 请求至 \"/api/v1/favorites\"，请求体:\n      \"\"\"\n      {\"article_id\": 42}\n      \"\"\"\n    Then 响应状态码应为 400\n    And 响应体应包含错误码 \"already_favorited\"\n\n  Scenario: 收藏数达到上限\n    Given 用户已收藏 1000 篇文章\n    When 发送 POST 请求至 \"/api/v1/favorites\"\n    Then 响应状态码应为 400\n    And 响应体应包含错误码 \"favorite_limit_exceeded\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、编写要点\n\n| 要点 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 拆解 Product BDD | 每个 Product BDD Scenario 对应一个或多个后端 Scenario |\n| 关注 API 协议 | 请求/响应/状态码 |\n| 关注数据变更 | 数据库的增删改 |\n| 关注业务规则 | 幂等、上限、权限校验 |\n\n---\n\n*文档结束*\n","numLines":98,"startLine":1,"totalLines":98}},"tool_use_id":"call_39ae3c57cd11497f87f0c4e2","duration_ms":1}
